mindmap
  root((project-001 token map))
    Color
      canvas: #FFFFFF
      surface: #F8FAFC
      text: #0F172A
      muted: #64748B
      accent: #2563EB
      danger: #B91C1C
      border: #CBD5E1
    Type
      family: system sans
      scale: 12/16/20/24/32
      line-height: 1.25-1.6
    Space
      unit: 4px
      steps: 1,2,3,4,6,8,12,16
    Shape
      radius: 4/8/12
      border: 1px
    Motion
      duration: 120-240ms
      easing: ease-out
      reduced-motion: none
    Usage
      semantic names over raw values
      contrast AA minimum
      no color-only meaning
      stable focus indicator
Rationale: Semantic tokens support consistency and future theme substitution.
Quality gates: contrast is checked; names are reusable; raw values are not used in documented components; reduced motion is specified.
Repository intent: /shared/standards/tokens/project-001-token-map.mmd stores the portable token map.
Writing and publishing: document intent, value, and permitted use; use sentence case; publish changes only with contrast and regression checks.